# name: test/sql/errors/ducklake_mssql_missing_extension.test
# description: US5 — attaching ducklake:mssql:... without the mssql extension yields an mssql-mentioning error.
# group: [errors]
#
# The error wording differs by build config:
#   - ENABLE_MSSQL=ON, mssql not pre-loaded: our autoload nudge fires from
#     sqlserver_metadata_manager.cpp, containing "INSTALL mssql FROM community".
#   - dist-pipeline (no ENABLE_MSSQL): DuckDB's extension loader errors first
#     with `Extension "mssql.duckdb_extension" not found`.
# We assert only the common substring; the install-hint text itself is covered
# by the walkthrough fixture + integration tests.

require ducklake

# Intentionally do NOT load mssql in this test.

statement error
ATTACH 'ducklake:mssql:Server=localhost,1433;Database=ducklakedb;User Id=sa;Password=DuckLake!2026;TrustServerCertificate=true;' AS lake (DATA_PATH '{DATA_PATH}');
----
mssql
